ffiliate</a> </div> </div>  <div class=\"card\"> <div class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-graduation-cap\"></i></div> <h3>NightOrbit Store &amp; Education</h3> <p>Next-generation multi-vendor e-commerce with automated shipping integrations and secure escrow payments.</p> <div class=\"link-group\"> <span class=\"label\">🔗 Store Link</span> <a href=\"https://nightorbittech.web.app/store\" target=\"_blank\">nightorbittech.web.app/store</a> <span class=\"label\" style=\"margin-top:0.5rem;\">🔗 Education Link</span> <a href=\"https://nightorbittech.web.app/education\" target=\"_blank\">nightorbittech.web.app/education</a> <span class=\"label\" style=\"margin-top:0.5rem;\">💸 Affiliates (Coming Soon)</span> <a href=\"mailto:nightorbit.official@gmail.com?subject=Affiliate Request\">Contact for Access</a> </div> </div> </div> </div>  <div class=\"master-banner\" id=\"master-affiliate\"> <h2>Become a <span class=\"highlight-green\">Nightorbit Master Affiliate</span></h2> <p>Attach your existing business or distribution channels to our network and unlock a <strong style=\"color:#fff;\">40% Lifetime Commission</strong> across all our tools, education hubs, and SaaS platforms.</p> <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center;\"> <span style=\"color: var(--text-body);\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\" style=\"color: var(--green);\"></i> Instant global tracking &amp; multi-currency payouts (USD/PKR)</span> <span style=\"color: var(--text-body);\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\" style=\"color: var(--green);\"></i> Full administrative dashboard &amp; custom link generation</span> <span style=\"color: var(--text-body);\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\" style=\"color: var(--green);\"></i> Dedicated business onboarding support</span> </div> <div style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\"> <a href=\"mailto:nightorbit.official@gmail.com?subject=Master Affiliate Request (40%)\" class=\"btn-green\"><i class=\"fas fa-crown\"></i> Apply for Master Affiliate</a> </div> </div>  <div class=\"section\"> <h2 class=\"section-title\">Our <span class=\"highlight\">Tech Stack</span></h2> <div class=\"tech-stack\"> <div class=\"tech-item\"><i class=\"fab fa-firebase\"></i><span class=\"name\">Firebase</span></div> <div class=\"tech-item\"><i class=\"fab fa-google\"></i><span class=\"name\">GCP</span></div> <div class=\"tech-item\"><i class=\"fab fa-js\"></i><span class=\"name\">JavaScript</span></div> <div class=\"tech-item\"><i class=\"fab fa-react\"></i><span class=\"name\">React</span></div> <div class=\"tech-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-database\"></i><span class=\"name\">Realtime DB</span></div> <div class=\"tech-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-cloud\"></i><span class=\"name\">Cloud Functions</span></div> <div class=\"tech-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-lock\"></i><span class=\"name\">ZTNA</span></div> <div class=\"tech-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-robot\"></i><span class=\"name\">AI</span></div> </div> </div>  <div class=\"section\"> <h2 class=\"section-title\">What Our <span class=\"highlight\">Users Say</span></h2> <div class=\"testimonial-grid\"> <div class=\"testimonial\"> <div class=\"quote\">\"Nightorbit's platforms are incredibly secure and fast. I've been using Gyidi Bazar for months and the real-time coin system is flawless.\"</div> <div class=\"author\">— Ahmed R. <span>Pakistan</span></div> </div> <div class=\"testimonial\"> <div class=\"quote\">\"The Birthday Card Generator is a lifesaver! I've made over 200 cards for my clients and they love the VIP features.\"</div> <div class=\"author\">— Sarah K. <span>UAE</span></div> </div> <div class=\"testimonial\"> <div class=\"quote\">\"I joined the affiliate program and earned 20% commission within the first week. The dashboard is intuitive and payouts are instant.\"</div> <div class=\"author\">— Usman M. <span>UK</span></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section>    <section id=\"page-journey\" class=\"page\"> <div class=\"container\" style=\"padding: 3rem 0;\"> <h2 class=\"section-title\">The <span class=\"highlight\">Evolution Journey</span> (2022 – 2026)</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">From a single experimental webpage to a globally recognized technology enterprise.</p> <div class=\"timeline-container\"> <div class=\"milestone\"> <div class=\"year\">2022 — FOUNDATIONS</div> <h3>Inception of Gyidi Bazar</h3> <p>Started as an experimental web application with a single HTML page. Focused on learning web hosting, domain management, and basic digital presence. This phase laid the groundwork for understanding user behavior and platform requirements.</p> </div> <div class=\"milestone\"> <div class=\"year\">2023 — STRUCTURING</div> <h3>Building the Core &amp; Facing Rejections</h3> <p>Evolved from basic HTML to structured platforms. Added login systems and reached out to local brands. Faced initial partnership rejections, which drove the decision to build a unified, self-sustaining ecosystem rather than relying on third-party approvals.</p> </div> <div class=\"milestone\"> <div class=\"year\">2024 — SCALABILITY &amp; BREAKTHROUGH</div> <h3>Launch of Birthday Card &amp; First Enterprise Brands</h3> <p>Launched the Birthday Card Generator and formed the first direct affiliate relationships with enterprise brands like Foodpanda and TazaOnline. This marked the first revenue streams and validated the platform's earning potential.</p> </div> <div class=\"milestone\"> <div class=\"year\">2025 — AUTOMATION &amp; INFRASTRUCTURE MIGRATION</div> <h3>Firebase Cloud, RapidGateway &amp; Anti-Cheat Architecture</h3> <p>Migrated the entire infrastructure to Firebase Cloud, integrating Realtime Database and Cloud Functions. Launched automated anti-cheat mechanisms, OTP verification, and real-time surveillance. Implemented RapidGateway for instant VIP activations (1–5 seconds).</p> </div> <div class=\"milestone\"> <div class=\"year\">2026 — CORPORATE ONBOARDING</div> <h3>Official Registration &amp; Global Team Expansion</h3> <p>Officially registered Nightorbit (Gyidi) with FBR Pakistan (Reg. No. 3520222320637, NTN: J707134-4). Established the head office in Lahore. Expanded the core execution team to 155+ experts across operations, QA, security, and marketing. Now serving 50K+ users globally.</p> </div> </div> <div style=\"background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 2rem; padding: 2rem; text-align: center; margin-top: 2rem;\"> <p style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\"> <i class=\"fas fa-quote-left\" style=\"color: var(--blue);\"></i> From a single HTML file to a global company — built by one person, now carried by a team of 155+. <i class=\"fas fa-quote-right\" style=\"color: var(--blue);\"></i> </p> <p style=\"color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 0.3rem;\">— Anas Farooq, Founder &amp; CEO</p> </div> </div> </section>    <footer class=\"footer\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div> <h4>Nightorbit (Gyidi)</h4> <p style=\"color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem;\">FBR Registered · Pakistan<br>Reg. No. 3520222320637<br>NTN: J707134-4</p> <p style=\"color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;\">📍 Headquarters: Lahore, Pakistan</p> </div> <div> <h4>Legal</h4> <a href=\"https://nightorbittech.web.app/privacy\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fas fa-shield-alt\"></i> Privacy Policy</a> <a href=\"https://nightorbittech.web.app/Cookie\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fas fa-cookie-bite\"></i> Cookie Policy</a> <a href=\"https://nightorbittech.web.app/terms\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fas fa-file-contract\"></i> Terms of Service</a> <a href=\"https://nightorbittech.web.app/security\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fas fa-lock\"></i> Security</a> </div> <div> <h4>Quick Links</h4> <a href=\"https://nightorbittech.web.app/team\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fas fa-users\"></i> Team</a> <a href=\"https://nightorbittech.web.app/authority\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fas fa-gavel\"></i> Authority</a> <a href=\"https://nightorbittech.web.app/contact\" target=\"_blank